    <string name="wind_allow_title">Allow wind</string>
    <string name="wind_allow_text">Wind comes from the US National Weather Service, drawn as moving air over the map.\n\nTurning it on lets Atmosphere ask them for wind over the part of the map you are looking at. Nothing else about you is sent.\n\nServer: nomads.ncep.noaa.gov</string>
    <string name="radar_allow_title">Allow radar</string>
    <string name="radar_allow_text">Radar comes from the US National Weather Service, the same picture their own radar site draws.\n\nTurning it on lets Atmosphere ask them for radar over the part of the map you are looking at. Nothing else about you is sent.\n\nServer: opengeo.ncep.noaa.gov</string>
